DELETE /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/cloudforce-one/requests/priority/{priority_id}
Deletes a priority intelligence request from Cloudforce One.
Required: account_id (path); priority_id (path)

GET /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/cloudforce-one/requests/priority/{priority_id}
Retrieves a specific priority intelligence request from Cloudforce One.
Required: account_id (path); priority_id (path)

PUT /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/cloudforce-one/requests/priority/{priority_id}
Updates a priority intelligence request in Cloudforce One.
Required: account_id (path); priority_id (path); body (body)

DELETE /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/cloudforce-one/requests/{request_id}/asset/{asset_id}
Removes an asset from a Cloudforce One intelligence request.
Required: account_id (path); request_id (path); asset_id (path)

GET /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/cloudforce-one/requests/{request_id}/asset/{asset_id}
Retrieves an asset attached to a Cloudforce One intelligence request.
Required: account_id (path); request_id (path); asset_id (path)

PUT /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/cloudforce-one/requests/{request_id}/asset/{asset_id}
Updates an asset in a Cloudforce One intelligence request.
Required: account_id (path); request_id (path); asset_id (path); body (body)

DELETE /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/cloudforce-one/requests/{request_id}
Deletes a Cloudforce One intelligence request and all associated data.
Required: account_id (path); request_id (path)

GET /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/cloudforce-one/requests/{request_id}
Retrieves details for a specific Cloudforce One intelligence request.
Required: account_id (path); request_id (path)

DELETE /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/cloudforce-one/requests/{request_id}/message/{message_id}
Removes a message from a Cloudforce One intelligence request thread.
Required: account_id (path); request_id (path); message_id (path)

PUT /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/cloudforce-one/requests/{request_id}/message/{message_id}
Updates a message in a Cloudforce One intelligence request thread.
Required: account_id (path); request_id (path); message_id (path); body (body)

PUT /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/cloudforce-one/requests/{request_id}
Updating a request alters the request in the Cloudforce One queue. This API may be used to update any attributes of the request after the initial submission. Only fields that you choose to update need to be add to the request body.
Required: account_id (path); request_id (path); body (body)

GET /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/cloudforce-one/v2/requests/{project_type}/{request_id}/messages/{message_id}
Returns the details for a specific message belonging to an RFI request.
Required: account_id (path); project_type (path); request_id (path); message_id (path)

GET /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/cloudforce-one/v2/requests/{project_type}/{request_id}
Retrieves a specific RFI by its UUID with related data.
Required: account_id (path) — Account ID.; project_type (path) — RFI project type. Valid values: threat-intelligence, incident-response, ir-emergency-response, table-top, pentest, irp, threat-hunting, cybersecurity-assessment, react-general, legal-response, soc-alerts, demo; request_id (path) — RFI UUID
